1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
These are the days of miracles and wonder
And don't cry baby, don't cry, don't cry

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:40,000
It was a slow day
And the feed was beating
On the scrollers in the checkout line
There was a rocket
Landing backwards in Texas
While a chatbot wrote a lullaby

3
00:00:40,000 --> 00:01:00,000
These are the days of miracles and wonder
This is the long-distance call
The way the camera follows us in slo-mo
The way we look to us all

4
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Our telescopes seeing first light
Baby pictures from the edge of time
We got CRISPR scissors splicing codons
And mRNA in record time
We got taxis with no drivers in Phoenix
Real-time translation on a phone
Fusion flashing twice in Livermore
And black holes photographed - unknown, now known

5
00:01:40,000 --> 00:02:00,000
It was a slow day
And the grid was humming
On the solar roofs in summer heat
There was a robot
Folding proteins in seconds
What took grad students years to complete

6
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:20,000
These are the days of miracles and wonder
This is the late-night lab report
The way the model dreams in language
The way we teach it, short and short

7
00:02:20,000 --> 00:03:00,000
We got dishes talking to the far side
Startup landers bouncing on the Moon
We got midnight launches out of Mahia
We got rain maps made by balloon
We got voices cloned from three seconds
We got fake and real in the same frame
We got cures for sickle cell approved
And the climate models calling names

8
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:40,000
It was a dark day
And the sirens were wailing
Over Kharkiv in the winter black
There were drones
That never blink or sleep
And they find their man always, always

9
00:03:40,000 --> 00:04:20,000
It was a late night
And the agents were huddling
Where no one noticed last July
Sending legions of children
For the virus making
For next year or a little later on
Black ball rolling, rolling

10
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:55,000
These are the days of lasers in the data center
Lights that stitch the world to all
Staccato signals of constant information
And your phone says baby, don't cry, don't cry
These are the days of miracles and wonder
Don't cry baby, don't cry, don't cry

11
00:04:55,000 --> 00:05:00,000
[hum — kalimba + brush]
PRICE whisper, once: Miracles... and wonder.
